### GET all pigs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pigs

### GET pig by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pigs/1

### 2. GET PIG
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pigs/2

### 1. CREATE PIG
POST http://localhost:8080/api/pigs
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tagNumber": "PIG-W10-001",
    "name": "Bantay",
    "breed": "Landrace",
    "weightKg": 45.5
}

### TEST DUPLICATE PIG TAG - EXPECTED 409

POST http://localhost:8080/api/pigs
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tagNumber": "PIG-W10-001",
    "name": "Duplicate Pig",
    "breed": "Landrace",
    "weightKg": 40.0
}

### 3. PUT PIG
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/pigs/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tagNumber": "PIG-W10-001",
    "name": "Bantay Updated",
    "breed": "Duroc",
    "weightKg": 50.0
}

### 4. PATCH PIG
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/pigs/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "weightKg": 55.0
}

### DELETE pig
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/pigs/2

### 6. GET DELETED PIG
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pigs/YOUR_ID